   122	        # §8 (redo): per-episode HORIZONTAL tracking standoff (metres the UAV TRAILS the
   123	        # target — applied in expert_action) → randomises the target's forward/depth position
   124	        # in the frame → decorrelates its depth RANK. NOT altitude (that only scales absolute
   125	        # depth uniformly, leaving the rank — the actual `nearest` shortcut — unchanged).
   126	        _dec = self._config.get("scene", {}).get("decorrelate_position", {})
