   976	        (set_route) so it leaves the UAV's forward view. A pure forward sprint does NOT work
   977	        (target just gets far & small while staying in the forward frame, and the gap becomes
   978	        un-re-acquirable); a TURN makes the target go off-frame while staying CLOSE, so the
